8 3 "// PyCArg_repr: the value as its union member holds it (signed for b/B, h/H, i/I, l/L, q/Q)"] [610 2 "// function pointers"] [698 1 "// makeLimitedModule is CPython's _testlimitedcapi (queue 262), the world's module made from its PyInit (single-phase:"] [699 1 "// PyModule_Create2's module, whose functions are bound to it), its parts built by ci but heaptype_relative.c and"] [700 1 "// vectorcall_limited.c (types from specs, not provided)."] [757 1 "// pointerSlice is Pointer_subscript's slice case."] [822 1 "// getset is a property-like descriptor (char arrays' value and raw)."] [844 1 "// ---- the module ----"] [850 1 "// closureAddr is the address of a native of the world (the module's helpers C code may call: _string_at_addr ...)."] [876 2 "// ArgumentError(Exception), in the module ctypes"] [1009 16 "// the instance's value learns its wrapper (its __dict__ is the wrapper's)"] [1043 2 "// the helpers' addresses: libc's memmove and memset, and natives of the world for string_at, wstring_at, cast and"] [1044 2 "// memoryview_at (CPython's are C functions of _ctypes taking PyObject *: here natives over the handles)"] [1082 3 "// queue 260: a view of the world's memory in place (PyMemoryView_FromMemory, PyBUF_READ or PyBUF_WRITE)"] [1110 1 "// pendingErr is an exception a native helper (cast) raised, raised again by the call that called it."] [1113 1 "// castImpl is callproc.c's cast: an instance of ctype whose pointer is ptr, keeping src alive."] [1129 3 "// cast's: the result shares the source's b_objects (a dict made when it is None: PyCData_GetContainer"] [1130 3 "// first, then obj->b_objects itself), the source kept in it by its id (queue 261: test_p2a_objects)"] [1146 1 "// the module _ctypes_test: the C library's file name (CDLL(_ctypes_test.__file__) is the world) and the module"] [1147 1 "// functions of Modules/_ctypes/_ctypes_test.c that read its state (the C API's part, 244-3, is not given yet)"] [1157 1 "// makeTestModuleGo was the module's Go sta